    "body": "[BIP 3](https://github.com/bitcoin/bips/blob/master/bip-0003.md#overview) limits the Title header to 50 characters. However, buildtable.pl reads the preamble without decoding UTF-8, so length() counts bytes and rejects some titles within that limit.\n\nFor example, the existing BIP 450 title, `Formosa—Seed encoding by themed mnemonic stories`, contains 48 characters and 50 UTF-8 bytes. Appending `!` produces 49 characters but 51 bytes, which the current validator rejects:\n\n    bip-0450.mediawiki has too-long Title (51 > 50 char max)\n\nDecode UTF-8 only for the length check. Use FB_CROAK to reject malformed UTF-8 and LEAVE_SRC to preserve the original title bytes for table output.\n\nAdd regression tests for both MediaWiki and Markdown preambles, covering ASCII and UTF-8 length boundaries, the BIP 450 example, malformed UTF-8, and preservation of output bytes. Run these tests in the existing Build-Table-Checks job.\n\nValidation:\n- `prove scripts/buildtable.t` — all 24 subtests pass.\n- `perl -c scripts/buildtable.pl`\n- `scripts/link-format-chk.sh`\n- `scripts/diffcheck.sh`\n- `typos`\n- Generated table output and diagnostics for all existing BIPs are byte-for-byte identical before and after the change.",
