      "updated_at": "2026-11-18T18:12:14Z",
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "The change makes sense to me and seems correct. The existing BIPs are encoded either in pure ASCII or UTF-8, so the strict failure should be fine. However, I don’t think we need the test here, could you please reduce the PR to just the changes to `buildtable.pl`?",
      "user": {
        "login": "murchandamus",
        "id": 4060799,
        "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjQwNjA3OTk=",
